# WileyWorx site — Cursor rules

## Project
Personal director / producer / EP portfolio for Jack Wiley (WileyWorx LLC).
- Stack: Astro, static, Vercel.
- This workspace: `/Users/jackwiley/Downloads/wileyworx-site`
- GitHub: WileyWorx/wileyworx-site
- Domain: wileyworx.com (cut over from Network Solutions when DNS is ready)

## Hard boundaries
- Work only on WileyWorx from this workspace.
- Do not modify Gasworks (`gasworks-site`) or Property Pocket from this repo.

## Positioning
Lead with director, producer, and EP for commercial productions. Camera and DP are the foundation, not the headline. Do not rebuild a services mill (seniors, weddings, acting reel as primary nav).

## Copy
No hyphens, en dashes, or em dashes in visitor-facing text unless required (phone numbers, URLs, filenames, legal brand spellings). Prefer periods, commas, or colons. Do not call WileyWorx a production company or production house.

## Responsive
Follow `RESPONSIVE.md`. Tokens in `src/styles/tokens.css` are the only source for type, space, breakpoints, and container widths. Do not add `max-width` media queries, `vh`, pixel font sizes, or fixed layout widths. Components must work at 320px, in an arbitrary container, and with long titles. Parents own outer spacing.

## Git
After completing a task that changes this site, commit and push to main without asking, unless the user says to stop.
